flowchart TD
  TX[Physical RC Transmitter] -->|RF| RX[Bound Receiver]
  RX -->|UART CRSF candidate| RDA[RC Decode and Radio Health Adapter]
  SIM[PC Virtual Input] --> VAL[Canonical Input Validation]
  BENCH[Authenticated Bench Setup UI] --> VAL
  RDA --> VAL
  VAL --> AUTH[Single Source Authority and Arm Edge]
  AUTH --> SAFE[Safety Supervisor and State Machine]
  BAT[Battery and Power Health] --> SAFE
  TMR[Monotonic Clock / Scheduler Health] --> SAFE
  SAFE --> MOT[Wing Motion Profile and Mixer]
  MOT --> ENV[Measured Servo Envelope Gate]
  ENV --> HAL[Servo PWM HAL]
  HAL --> WL[Wing L]
  HAL --> WR[Wing R]
  SAFE -.-> TLM[Read-only Telemetry / Diagnostics]
  ENV -.-> TLM
  TLM -.-> BENCH
  NOTE[Airborne status UNKNOWN unless proven with sensing] -.-> SAFE
